# Build context of the admin image is the repository root; this file (next to
# the Dockerfile, picked up by BuildKit) restricts it to an allowlist.
# Other apps, local node_modules/dist (host binaries), .env files and tooling
# such as .claude/ never reach the image. Add new paths here deliberately.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/admin/
!infra/docker/admin/

apps/admin/node_modules/
apps/admin/dist/
apps/admin/coverage/
apps/admin/.env*
infra/docker/admin/Dockerfile*
**/.DS_Store
**/.gitignore
